  omitted by construction. No absolute filesystem path appears anywhere in this file; every path written
  here is repository relative. The register of JDK internal access exceptions is likewise named by TITLE
  ONLY, because its own path embeds one of the tokens under audit; it is delivered empty, with a positive
  statement that the migrated production launch configuration requires none.
  This class is directly relevant to that finding rather than merely adjacent to it. It extends the
  legacy mocking support base class, and the mocking library is exactly where the accessibility failure
  surfaced; the resolution was to advance that library, never to widen access for the application.

